# PLAY — leave the cursor at this score and Cmd/Ctrl+E.
# Q/A: N digit; W/S: U digit; E/D: D digit; R/F: Hz;
# T/G and Y/H: volume endpoints; U/J: FM index;
# I/K, O/L, P/; and [/apostrophe: ADSR stages.
# Hold Shift for a finer decimal step (discrete digits remain whole).
# U L = next loop; U W = live writing; PLAY also performs hot edits with manual U.
# Cmd/Ctrl+E again restores ordinary typing. E in the bottom bar does the same.
